This subdirectory 'fit' contains input and output of fits with finite-range
pairing. 

It contains sample input in the file 'for001.<name>' and corresponding
output in the file 'for002.<name>' where '<name>' is an obvious name
describing the actual case. The name is derived from the corresponding
functional with soft cutoff pairing. The ending 'all' means a refit of
all model parameters, while 'pairpar' indicates a fit where only the
pairing parameters had been re-fitted.


